<title>AUSTRIA: Welteke says must take account of all EMU criteria.</title>
<headline>Welteke says must take account of all EMU criteria.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Ernst Welteke said on Wednesday it was important to take account of all the Maastricht criteria for participation in a single European currency.</p>
<p>He said the European Union had already achieved successes in price and exchange rate stability.</p>
<p>&quot;It was clear from the beginning that some small countries have a problem with the debt criteria. We have to look at the whole picture,&quot; Welteke told reporters. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
